**[The Halberd and the Split]**
- Brewbarry moves in and hits the jelly with a halberd.
- The GM rules the jelly immune to slashing damage — the blow instead splits it into two smaller jellies.
- Soma discovers he had been reading initiative off the wrong character sheet and is even slower than reported (8, +1 bonus).
